WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:06,770
Four Demons is not a charity

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:09,250
Only those with Huo Chicheng ID cards are eligible to queue up.

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,850
Anyone who doesn't follow the rules will be kicked out.

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:11,850
One serving per person

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,330
Let me find out who gets more

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,450
Don't blame me for being rude

7
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,970
The four demons are really determined to change their minds.

8
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,690
No matter where you go, it's illegal to sit on the belt

9
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:21,130
Huo Chicheng is hot and dry

10
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,890
They still have to wait like this at the gate of Red Demon

11
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,170
They are so pitiful

12
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:26,170
I was just playing bead hunting downstairs

13
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,610
The children here have never even played pearl hunting.

14
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:30,890
They can only take a bath once during the Chinese New Year

15
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:38,880
They have a sexy saying

16
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:41,520
The fiery red man will give every drop of blood to the desert

17
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,480
Born in the desert, buried in the desert

18
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,240
The average male in the city does not live to be 28 years old

19
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,130
Could you please stop suddenly opening a cave?
